{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2023-04-19 14:00:00', 'title': 'BORGWARNER ANNOUNCES PLAN TO INVEST $20 MILLION IN MICHIGAN FACILITIES, CREATE 186 JOBS', 'text': 'INVESTMENT TO SPAN THREE EXISTING MICHIGAN FACILITIES AND A NEW EV BATTERY SERVICE CENTER PLAN ENABLES THE ACCELERATION OF ELECTRIC VEHICLE PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT AND TESTING WHILE INCREASING U.S. DOMESTIC MANUFACTURING CAPABILITIES BORGWARNER RECEIVED A $1.86 MILLION GRANT FROM THE MICHIGAN ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT CORPORATION (MEDC) AUBURN HILLS, MICH. , APRIL 19, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BORGWARNER HAS ANNOUNCED ITS PLAN TO INVEST $20 MILLION INTO EXPANDING THE CAPABILITIES OF THREE EXISTING MICHIGAN-BASED FACILITIES AND DEVELOPING A NEW ELECTRIC VEHICLE (EV) BATTERY SERVICE CENTER.'}